Why DSA Remains Fundamental
DSA is the foundation of efficient software development because every application relies on organizing data and processing it effectively. Whether building a compiler, database, operating system, web application, game engine, or AI system, choosing the right data structure and algorithm has a direct impact on performance, memory usage, and scalability. This is why DSA is a core subject in computer science education and a central topic in technical interviews.

Q) Largest in Array:

-> Approach 1:class Solution {
  public:
    int largest(vector<int> &arr) {
        // code here
        int n = arr.size();
        sort(arr.begin(), arr.end());
        return arr[n-1];
    }
};

-> Approach 2: class Solution {
  public:
    int largest(vector<int> &arr) {
        // code here
        int n =arr.size();
        int large = INT_MIN;
        for(int i=0; i<n; i++){
            if(arr[i]>large){
                large = arr[i];
            }
        }
        return large;
    }
};


